Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Verify the first proposed moves", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"8a57b5c1-9aa6-2747-a0bd-fd8be21f8484"],

Cell["\<\
For each geometry, the original center and the best 1,000,000-point stencil \
candidate are checked at 2,000,000 MaxPoints. A move is accepted only when it \
is lower at both budgets and its high-budget improvement exceeds both 0.02 Ry \
and the cross-budget disagreement.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a94fafc9-e353-794b-bd61-e61f561c53aa"],

