Cell["Half-step directional refinement", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"c80c6a9c-2156-e342-b78e-632fd6608d23"],

Cell["\<\
For each geometry, the two most promising initial coordinate directions are \
tested at plus and minus half steps around its accepted center. This produces \
24 shared-queue candidates at 1,000,000 MaxPoints.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"236914d2-86f9-9745-a36f-38b9f95ee83c"],

