Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Results, error diagnostics, and timing", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"1971119c-31b4-4e47-955c-302c3fea7bae"],

Cell["\<\
The summary reports corrected X and XX energies, total energies, binding \
energies, final parameters, and rough propagated integration errors. The \
candidate table contains timing per parameter point. The integrals CSV \
contains the separate numerator and denominator timings, warning text, and \
reported NIntegrate error estimates.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4a1e5147-0822-5f4b-85b1-052e8e3150de"],

